, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༙༢༧༬༦༳༨༛༈༲༌༗༖༯༗༽༻༾ༀ༄༉༾༜༻༲༓༴༬༒༬༗༲་༬༨༻༐༗༔༭༧༉་༫༳༖༒༊༹༘</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1408.03,"y":369.09,"cell":29318,"i":299,"name":"Wittengen Sculpture","note":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">Ⳝ⳩ⳬⲸⳫⳞⳐⳊⳂⳢⳎⳔⳚⳞⳢⲸⳜⳀⳈⳃⲺⳚⳁ⳩ ⲼⳒⲼ⳩⳹⳥ⳫⳠⳬⳚⳁ ⲼⳃⳃⳲⳤⳄⳫⳎⳢⳆ ⳊⳂⳔⳊⳐⳠⳁⲶⲼ ⳧ⳒⳄⳘⳔⳭⳲ⳩⳾⳥ⳀⳀⳭⲼⳊⳭ </div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1311.7,"y":903.2,"cell":87084,"i":300,"name":"Alehe Megalith","note":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᢏᢡᢢᡝᠵᠦᡳᠧᡐᠻᠧᡭᡔᡟᢓᠩᢑᢜᠩᡏᡜᠡᡳᡕᡀᠠᡟᢑᡆ᠑ᡗᡮᠡᠼᢡᢥᢞᡭᢀᢂᡕᡕᠵᠽᡑᢟᡯᡴᡑᠩᢐᡴᡔᢒᢟᢁ᠀ᡆᢠᡠᢛ᠀ᡓᢛᡮ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":766.86,"y":633.17,"cell":71069,"i":301,"name":"Cueyoahualman Megalith","note":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༪༂༌༺༴༼༇༃༭༬༧་༻༭༺༰༦༬༺༧༁༩༙༿༑༧༆༇༥༻༊༉༱༡༱༭༰༰༴༑༕༴༨༲༫༢༶༚༔༫༐༘༖༻༪༧༘༮༜༌</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":433.85,"y":1030.99,"cell":98657,"i":302,"name":"Sribihalgi Column","note":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༡༱༧༆༷༻༒༡༤༡༻༤༈༉༫༿༲༐༽༾༃༊༳༡༆༌ༀ༈༯༢༣༠༶༔༜༄༡༬༥༊༕༃༓༽༉༌་༁༈༢༉༐༤༐༸༨ༀ༘༻༪༔༰༴༣༯ༀ༜༈༚༠༱༑༡ༀ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":467.21,"y":909.33,"cell":87820,"i":303,"name":"Alawiyah Stele","note":"An ancient stele. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡕᡓᢁᡞᠰᢢ᠑ᠱ᠒ᡐᠲᠵᠦᠭ᠑ᡗᡍᡙᢡᡟᢀᢂ᠒ᢢᡑᢂᠯᡑᢏᢐᠲᠩ᠒ᡒᡀᡕᡓᡜᢋᡯᡜᠱᢡᡑᠼᢟᢟᡙᠮᢤᢀᠵ᠐ᠳᠭᡗᠿᡆᡕᡲᠪᡓᠼᢓᠨᢞᠾᡔᢦᡲᡮᡝᡯᡎᢦᠰ᠒ᢁᢛᡆᠳᠠᡝᠾ᠑ᡒᡰᠯ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":188.58,"y":662.89,"cell":73799,"i":304,"name":"Chenzhou Obelisk","note":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༌༓༦༅༾༰༃༡༫༠༗༲༸༘༠༘༲་༂༽༬༓་༺༌༔༳༻་༮༲༖༘༔༶༺༶༭༲ༀ༥༧༅༈༇༼༼༦</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1395.94,"y":523.52,"cell":57789,"i":305,"name":"Ungen Effigy","note":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc29\udc0e\udc0f\udc37𐠮\udc0f\udc28\udc0b\udc13\ud802 \ud802\ud802𐠊 \udc0b\udc26\udc21\ud802𐠦\ud802\ud802𐠳\ud802\ud802𐠬 \udc02\udc2d𐠗𐠗\udc25\udc15 \ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠯\udc1b\udc27 \udc14\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠖\udc14\udc1b\ud802\ud802𐠢\udc27𐠌\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802 𐠬\udc04𐠡𐠃\udc32</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1466.92,"y":860.04,"cell":82577,"i":306,"name":"Pouhula Effigy","note":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc26 𐠟\udc0f\ud802 𐠒\udc2e \udc17\udc26\udc28\udc18\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠍𐠦\udc16\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠷\udc2b\udc08\ud802\ud802𐠘\udc12\udc1f\udc20\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802 \udc0d\udc0e\udc14\udc1b𐠊\udc31\ud802</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":847.98,"y":460.72,"cell":47033,"i":307,"name":"Hamyangseon Monolith","note":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᠯᠱᡙ᠀ᢥᡒᢦᡍᢓᢒᠨᢐᡁᢜᡕᡭᡡᠱ᠒ᠦᠳᠮᠠᠰᡳᡕᡕᠮᡱᡕᡀᡆ᠀ᢥᢏᢑ᠐ᠮᠿᡆᡁᢋᡡᢋ᠀ᠾᠩ᠑ᢏᢞᡁ᠐ᠡᢥᡲᡐᠠᢑ᠀ᡑ᠒ᢀᢋᠧᡰᠻᡁᡠᠦᠼᢞᡠᠵᠧᠻᠾᢠᠼᢋᠨᢥᡓᡜᠧᡕᠪᡖᢓᠦᠵ᠑ᡱᢏᢒᡔᠱ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":301.02,"y":641.6,"cell":71854,"i":308,"name":"Nanchang Idol","note":"An ancient idol. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳊⲸⳤⳜ⳾⳪ⲸⳖ ⳤⳤⲼⳈⳠⳠ⳥Ⳋ ⳃ⳥ⳲⳀⳀⳠ ⳘⳐⳭⳫⳌ ⳐⳈⳜ⳪Ⳉ⳥Ⳃ⳪ⳬⳀⳠⳘⳐⳚ⳾ⳬⳖ⳹ⳜⳭⳒⳆⳒⳭⳊⳆⳁ⳩ ⳤⳜⳫⳞ⳪ⳀⳄⳫ⳩ ⳆⳀⳚⳤ⳩ⲶⳠⲴ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1474.28,"y":346.26,"cell":25224,"i":309,"name":"Kustettnau Column","note":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">𐠭\udc1b \ud802𐠙\udc03𐠥\ud802 \udc29\udc2d 𐠜\udc2a\udc17\udc0a\udc34𐠢\udc38\udc0c\udc38\udc16\udc33\ud802\ud802𐠡\udc1e𐠝\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠗\ud802\ud802𐠝\udc2e\udc0b\ud802\ud802𐠢𐠳\udc1c \ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠰\udc34𐠣\udc15\udc05\udc1b\udc2e𐠠\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠦\ud802\ud802</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":256.08,"y":569.4,"cell":63867,"i":310,"name":"Jingyang Effigy","note":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᠯᡝᡐᠼᠻᡞᢓᠳᠪᡡᡝᢠᡔᢡᡀᠦᠿᢏ᠐ᠵ᠒᠀ᢐᠱᢐᠾᡯᡑᢋᢥᠭᠭᡎᡱᡀᠻᠵᢛᡏᢑᡀᡭᡖᢡᡓᡐᡑᢦᢜᠵᢢ᠐ᠠᠩᢦᢦᡕᡙᢏᡎᡎᡠᡏᡡᢦᡞ᠒ᡁ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":487.06,"y":184.78,"cell":6971,"i":311,"name":"Shilin Sculpture","note":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ወፀ የረሠ  ከፈሐኀኀለሠበመየሐነፈሀ ደፐለረጠፀሠጰፈዘገሠለረሰገጸሠዘሀፀከፈተለጠወመ ደበፈወኀለኀቀጠለነዐወፐሐ ፈቀወዐ ሀፈደዘሰ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":491.39,"y":390.81,"cell":33224,"i":312,"name":"Chizhao Monument","note":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༑༓༛༪༊༩༴༡༦༖༓༮༔༴༪༻༁༥༪༪༣ༀ༄༭༴༰༻ༀ༁༵༆༯༨༮ༀ༒༵༣༔༪༇༠༃༙༮༩༨༔༧༩༄༚༲༯༱༔༡༶༔༹༂༜༫༈༧༐༊༶༘༌༒༄༕༮༬༺༴༫༮༄༄༬༧༶༊༡༊༦༂༧༶༼</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":295.4,"y":350,"cell":25359,"i":313,"name":"Somisa Statue","note":"An ancient statue. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༰༯༅༉༾༉༙༆༾༐༛༈༳༱༰༌༹༾༜༙༊༙༘༓༓༻༔༛༩༷༸༻་༁༫༱༻༁༠༴༊༄༪༑༊༴༪༣༒ༀ༮༪༆༯༮༇༓༉༡༲༶༐༯༛༉༔༉༜༭༰ༀ༣༈༣༽༦༁༪༪༌༓༽༄༩༧</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":290.65,"y":896.4,"cell":86448,"i":314,"name":"Kildie Obelisk","note":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᢓᡗᡰᡁᡝᡟᢤᢁᡖᡯᢢᡆᠦᡞᠰᡱᠧ᠐᠑ᠠᠲᠩᡍᢛᢂᡕᡖᢂᡗᡀᡳᡀᢛᡡᠠᠲᡴᠯᡗᡖᠭᡐᠿ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":392.51,"y":1040.19,"cell":99363,"i":315,"name":"Aberleitle Monolith","note":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳞⳫⳂ ⳫⲾⲶⳎⳭⲼⳚ ⳩⳥ⳤ⳾ⳂⳢⲴⳄⲺⳞⳆⳔⳊⳌⳎⳜⳌ⳪ⳄⳐⳞⳎⳆⳲⲾ⳧⳹ ⳥ⳞⳫⳠ ⲾⳆⳲⲺⳜⳆⳤⲸⳃⳁⳖⲾ⳥ Ⳃ ⳲⳃⳤⳄⳂ⳾ⳊⳘⳎⲴⳎⳐⲾⳞ⳾ⳞⲺ⳩</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":353.97,"y":352.8,"cell":25892,"i":316,"name":"Tasawates Pillar","note":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᢥᢠᡑ᠐ᡖᡟᡎᢤ᠒ᡏᢢᡱᡯᠳᡓᠲᡠᡓᠦᡲ᠒ᡖᢑᡝᢐᡔᡲᡠᠵᢥᠯ᠒ᢀᢑ᠒ᡮᡯᠨᡳᠠᢓᢀᠼᡀᡯᡯᢜᢒᡁᠰᡗᢥᠯᢀᡑᡰ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":978.82,"y":381.15,"cell":31780,"i":317,"name":"Votynsk Monument","note":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc1a\udc23\udc0b\ud802 𐠮\ud802  𐠿\udc01\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠤\udc28\ud802\ud802𐠥\udc1c \udc0c\ud802𐠦\udc20\ud802𐠕\udc38\udc02\udc1b\udc03 𐠮 𐠝\udc31\ud802𐠨\udc05 \udc2e</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1164.44,"y":568.61,"cell":63993,"i":318,"name":"Patta Statue","note":"An ancient statue. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༂༅༕༄༷༗༠༓༲༿༩༅༻༾༦༼༲༊༴༸༷༑༌༜༖༃༲༰༃༵༜༪༰༊༅༂༊༮༻༑</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":519.05,"y":1008.56,"cell":97178,"i":319,"name":"Shora Megalith","note":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༹༵༓༁༴༅༦༚༐༿༸༨༗༻༴༴༼༉༶༽༣ༀ༒༐༂༐༅༰༙༩༜༨༥༉༡༣༹༔༭༇༴༈༺༐༻༹༧༹༰༶༱༮༲༺༉༷༦༩༤༒༪༻༉༗༸༻༪༤༶༴༉༤༼༂༙༤༩༸༧༢༜༒༅༄༈༽ༀ༽</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":280.99,"y":861.68,"cell":82752,"i":320,"name":"Ha Tho Monolith","note":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༐༼་༈༖ༀ༈༇༪༔༣༑༶་༌༴༾༙༨༯༽༣༤༗༗༜༷༊༧༦༬༴༒༃༗༻༢༯༈༳༛༑༡༔༃༦༛ༀ༖༲༘༭༇༨༘༭༁༶་༅༑༮༙༅</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":339.15,"y":1112.55,"cell":104315,"i":321,"name":"Peiaion Idol","note":"An ancient idol. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᢦᢞ᠒ᡍᢤᡒᠻᢞᡏᢠᠮᢑᡑᡕᡗᡀᢢᢜ᠐ᡡᡯᢁᠼᡝᠽᠡᢂᢑᡐᠼᠳᢓᠨᡴᡏᡭᢢᠳᠧᢡᠿᡲᡝᡁᠪᠧᡎᠾᡴᠲᡯᡜᢞᡔᢓᢥᢁᡞᡝᢒᡯᡑᢤᢜᢜᡀᡞᠲ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":148.13,"y":618.47,"cell":69243,"i":322,"name":"Binzhou Stele","note":"An ancient stele. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\"> መኀሀሠመወፈገመደየተሀፀለፐገአቀኀበሰ ወረተ ዘ ጠዘሐጰከጸገጠጠገጰገበፈ ቀፀለሐከሰረ ፀጸደየሠ ጠጸደፀረረረረአፀጰጠሰ </div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1718.33,"y":470.83,"cell":49278,"i":323,"name":"Mibendera Monolith","note":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᢥᠭᢂᡝᠵ᠑᠑ᢜᡀᢤᢂ᠐ᢀᡞᢁᡯᠾᠪᡞ᠀ᡳᠦᡭᢟᡟᡮᡞᢛᡎ᠑ᠼᠯᡗᢞᡲᡏᠽᡞᡭᠳᡮ᠑ᠧᢐᠡᡆᠠᢂᠮᡜᡗᡮᠦᢏᡑᡏᠨᢓᡑᡐᠯᢥᢞᢀ᠀ᠿ᠐ᠦᡖᢠᠾᡏᠽᠮᡑᡏᠡᡖᠼᠳᡝᡳᢛᡭᡗᡔᠡ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1240.52,"y":370.32,"cell":29788,"i":324,"name":"Fisch Sculpture","note":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc2b\udc1a\udc23\udc38 𐠘 \udc3c\udc0e\udc1a\udc19\udc24\udc2d\ud802𐠦\ud802𐠰\ud802𐠯\udc2e\udc31\udc33\udc0a\ud802\ud802𐠼𐠊𐠊𐠥 \udc3c\ud802𐠌𐠸\udc2e𐠫\ud802𐠩𐠠\udc2a\udc35\udc1d𐠱\udc28𐠄\udc2b\udc2c\ud802\ud802𐠙\udc14\udc18\udc15\udc1d\udc1d\udc32\udc11\udc28𐠥\udc1a\ud802𐠩\ud802\ud802 \udc0d\ud802\ud802𐠯𐠣\udc2a\ud802 \ud802\ud802𐠝</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1339.03,"y":989.69,"cell":95797,"i":325,"name":"Mapalane Pillar","note":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳤⲸⳈⳌⳞⳚⳘⲲⳘⳁⳃⳔⲼⳘⳆⲸⳀⲾ⳹ⳢⲶⳀⲼⳊⳒ Ⳡ Ⳝ ⳲⳄⳐ