ⳁⳌⳒⳄⳈ Ⳛ ⳁⳲⳘ⳾ⳭⳠ  ⳲⳞ⳩</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1517.18,"y":637.66,"cell":71518,"i":331,"name":"Modhnokh Megalith","note":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༣༳༺༅༵༠༼༰༈༅༜༨༢༮༨༉༓༐༃༫༔༪༜༢༉༉ༀ༹༕༥༖༈༛༣༲༊༶༆༑༾༿༲༆༣༖༪༜༉༶༚༥༯༢༼༘༷༭༪༔༕༅ༀ༲༆༤༽༰༢༗༯༾༿</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1549.3,"y":635.7,"cell":71237,"i":332,"name":"Uzdkog Megalith","note":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡴᢐᠯᡭᢂᠽᡒᢦᡍᡑᢋᡴᡝᡑᢟᡝᡍᢑᡝᢐᡠᢜᢂᠠᡜᡖᠦᠿ᠀ᢟᠧᡆᠭᢥᡳᡔᢞᢐᠪᡯᢛᢢᢞᡍᡡᠲᠩ᠐ᡍᠯᡭᡟᢞᡁᢐ᠐ᢥᡏ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":206.54,"y":588.47,"cell":66183,"i":333,"name":"Fuzhouai Runestone","note":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ሐደገአዘነነ ተዐጰየጰረገመሀሐበረሠመለፀየኀነገሀረተየዘዘጸሠፐለጠተገ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":334.12,"y":252.87,"cell":13214,"i":334,"name":"Chulandalsan Effigy","note":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᠻᢞᡴᠿᡭ᠀ᢦᡎᠾᢟᡲᠠᡐᡏ᠀ᡐᠲᠡᢑᡐᢋᡳᢤᠧᠵ᠀ᢁᠽᠻ᠒ᢏᠪᡰᡠᢏ᠐ᠵᠩᠱᡁ᠐ᠧᠯᡆᠽ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":549.16,"y":355.13,"cell":26477,"i":335,"name":"Chong Effigy","note":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc23 \udc15\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠮\udc22\udc18\ud802𐠿𐠎𐠡\udc20\udc0b\udc05\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠡\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802 \udc1d\udc1e𐠟𐠓\udc10\udc30\ud802 \ud802\ud802\ud802𐠔\ud802\ud802𐠴𐠢𐠼\udc0d\ud802𐠱</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":370.15,"y":859.37,"cell":82502,"i":336,"name":"Bontiaguca Monolith","note":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡞᠭᠭᢛᡟᢥ᠀ᡕᡓᢑᢐᡡᡙᠧᠨᡁᡎ᠐ᢒᠭᡓᠰ᠒ᡓᡳᢛᠻ᠑ᢥᡠᡞᢟᢁᡁᠽᡳᡜᡎᠳᡕᢜᢒᡯᡀᡑᡜᡏᢤᢟᡡᡯᡒᢁᢛᡲᠦᡆᠭᠧᠪᢟᡴᠽᡀᡜᢑᡱᠳᡞᢒᢞᢢ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":813.51,"y":641.8,"cell":71920,"i":337,"name":"Mayapexcala Obelisk","note":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᠵᡞᠻᡀᠲ᠐᠑ᢁᢓᠪᢥᡔᠯᡭᢒᡁᠲᡮᠨᢀᢓᡳᡭ᠑ᠨᢑᡆᠿᠱᢀᢦᠽᠼᠯᡠ᠒ᢜᡐᢂᢓᡱᡟᢐᠨᢂᢂᡎᡖᡞᠰᠳᢢᡯᡞᢡᢛᠲᢒᡴᢐᡟᠮᢜᡯᡎᢞᡟᢓᡕᡏᢢᠯᠮᠳᡐᢑᡀ᠑ᡐᠩ᠑ᢂᠰᡳᢛᠳᠪᡴᢛᡱᡙᢛᢑᡠᠪᢋᢂᢡ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1326.33,"y":282.92,"cell":16486,"i":338,"name":"Sewald Stele","note":"An ancient stele. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༮༨༽༲༲༄༬༧༘༦༶༖༃༭༔༮༹༂༳༴༓༾༁༉༚༛༬༒༑༄༩༛༑༯༥༬༱༒༆༡༆༕༒༫༴ༀ༴༒ༀ༭༨༉༉༨༣༽༷༆༔༽༭༭༥༉༵༘༯༃༳༼༱༷༨༲༛༖ༀ༆༮༴༛༳༪༩</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":279.49,"y":942.44,"cell":90648,"i":339,"name":"Kien Megalith","note":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡁᠠᠰᠨᢒᠪᡠ᠒ᡕᢏᢏ᠀ᢂᡯᡟᡐᢒᢥᡁᠨᡎᡙ᠀᠐ᡐᡕᢜᡰᠳᡲᢢᢞᠿᡁᡲᢐᠽᡱᠼᠧᢢᡓᠰᡜ᠑ᠾᠠᢓᠪᡮ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":847.65,"y":502.92,"cell":54409,"i":340,"name":"Geumposeong Pillar","note":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\"> ፀዘጰለወአከተጸለሠፈረፈሠፈ ረሀፀሐዐደጰየሐደሰወዐገኀነሰየለየገኀሠ ፐጰሠፐወፀዘደወወለፈጠ ገአ በረሀጸዘመተጠአገ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1363.1,"y":183.7,"cell":7046,"i":341,"name":"Mygerlit Effigy","note":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">𐠊\ud802𐠍\udc28\udc0c\ud802\ud802\ud802 \udc0d\udc0e\ud802𐠞𐠟\ud802𐠃𐠨\udc02𐠫𐠥\udc08\udc24\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802 \udc05\udc10\udc0d\ud802𐠈\udc0e\ud802\ud802𐠱\udc13\udc0d\udc38𐠑\udc11\udc37\udc11\udc15\udc29\ud802\ud802𐠘𐠡\udc2d𐠩 \udc20\udc24 𐠮\udc1d\udc2b\udc1b\udc1e\ud802\ud802 \udc2b𐠰\udc25\udc02\udc2f\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠒\udc29\udc1f</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":423.26,"y":993.5,"cell":95920,"i":342,"name":"Llan Megalith","note":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༫༻༳༭༽༊༁༯༸༤༧༮༯༖༪༜༾༿༆༮༔༳༬༆༰༖༛༼༹༩༶༜༑༧༴༿༳༬༷༃༛༙༼༅༻༖༹༠༰༊༥</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":280.29,"y":383.62,"cell":32084,"i":343,"name":"Kubetsu Obelisk","note":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᢁ᠀ᠱᢜᠦ᠑ᠪᡙᢓᢑᡕᡯᠨᡑᡟ᠀ᢁᢠᠼᠧᠿᡏᢢᡯᡔᡕᠲᠻᠽᠪᠡᡜᡑᡒᠰᠾᢤᠱᢥᠦᢂᡴᡎᠻᠱᢥ᠒ᢡᠧᡳᠧᢢᢥᢂᠵᢀᡲᡜᢐᢢᠪᡠᠮᡭᠧ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1332.95,"y":93.43,"cell":989,"i":344,"name":"Timassivik Obelisk","note":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">𐠜\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802 \ud802\ud802\ud802𐠭\udc1e𐠩\ud802\ud802 𐠋\udc12\udc25\udc15𐠚\udc24𐠦\udc22\ud802𐠛𐠿\udc0a\udc3c\ud802\ud802\ud802 𐠒\ud802 \ud802</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":274.74,"y":939.75,"cell":90392,"i":345,"name":"Binh Stele","note":"An ancient stele. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ዐፈ ደረለበዘነዘዘአኀበረፀሐፐጠዘጸከጠኀኀ የፐሰሰተሀጠፀከጸፀበ ጰ ሠተሐ  ጸነተ ዘተ ከ ተገአሀነዐአፀዐ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":246.39,"y":185.1,"cell":7157,"i":346,"name":"Erlen Statue","note":"An ancient statue. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᢜᠲᠪᢒᡝ᠒ᢏᢦᡴᢑᠼᠳᠦᡗᡮᠵᡑᡠᠱᠱᢏ᠒ᡰᠩᠻᡆᡜᠦᢤᢛᢦᢞᠪᢏᢑᠠᠿᠦᠲᠪᡠᡴᡎᠭᡱᡔᡜᠡᢦᢦᡑᠱᢏᢀᡓᠱᡒᠨᡯᠿᠪᡖᠦᢀᡱᠮᠿ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":488.33,"y":301.04,"cell":18291,"i":347,"name":"Puzhou Pillar","note":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\ud802\ud802 \udc29\ud802𐠗\ud802𐠜\udc15\udc15\udc31\udc38\ud802𐠦𐠥\ud802\ud802𐠛𐠂\udc01\udc0e𐠗𐠪\udc3c\ud802 \udc02 \udc1b\udc2e 𐠔𐠟 𐠪\udc2e\ud802\ud802 𐠱\udc3f\udc29\udc30\udc31𐠥\ud802\ud802</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":524.74,"y":713.81,"cell":76688,"i":348,"name":"Jarklausvi Obelisk","note":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༻༤༫༔༚༨༹༜༻་༧༨༱༔༉༣༯༌༚་༷༵༥ༀ༓༰༠༽༼༄༱༮༓༜༆༹ༀ༢༤༄༾༓༬༾༩༲༒༛༓༿་༔༘༊༃༷༁༑༹༲༭༂༁</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":164.19,"y":1005.99,"cell":96869,"i":349,"name":"Quang Obelisk","note":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༺༵༐༺༑༂༂༢༬༃༦༺༺༨༸༚༘༖༪༷༿༉ༀ༑༴༖༳༪༴༴༷༰་༲༳༮༆༦༩༸་༪༒༿༙༚༊༓༫༵༲༕༰༂༕༛༰༽༗༻༕༽༸༄༱༠༷༬</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":588.32,"y":229.38,"cell":11212,"i":350,"name":"Liuzhou Monolith","note":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\"> 𐠸\udc2b\udc24𐠜\udc0a𐠯\udc01\udc15\udc0f\udc32\udc05\udc24𐠤\udc3c \udc1c\udc32\udc28𐠠\udc1d\ud802\ud802𐠴\ud802\ud802𐠧\udc38\ud802𐠅\udc31𐠁\udc15𐠃\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠧\udc13 \udc2c\udc31\ud802𐠷\udc0d\ud802𐠡\udc2b𐠒\udc0d𐠵\udc0c\udc1f\udc26\udc15\udc0c\udc05\udc21\ud802𐠥\udc01\udc03\udc25\ud802𐠃𐠙\ud802</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":966.32,"y":511.11,"cell":55746,"i":351,"name":"Pyeon Pillar","note":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">་༧༾༨༈༙༬༖༣༘་༚༪༌༭༢༓༵༸༧༉༘༑༌༲༩༁༿ༀ༆༷༬༹༼༺༐༪༙༁༫༯༻༰༧༚༰༫༯༢༥༊༬༼༖༶༱༶༔༩༈༳༙༈༊ༀ༘༤༙༚༕༢༚༴༯༶༂༉༥༛༽༉༖༘༑༵༮</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":600.85,"y":1030.04,"cell":98720,"i":352,"name":"Shalingpur Monument","note":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ገሰ ገከየፐገኀሀፈወጠዐለ